      "review_summary": "The PR adds an undefined guard to `safeStringify` and a regression test for `summarizeAllowedValues([undefined])`.\n\nPR surface: Source +3, Tests +9. Total +12 across 2 files.\n\nReproducibility: yes. Current `main` falls through from `JSON.stringify(undefined)` to `String(value)`, so undefined formats as literal `undefined`; the PR body also includes before/after direct TS output. I did not run local tests because this review kept the checkout read-only.",
